{
  "id": 1701,
  "title": "Canada Lotto 649",
  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1701\" class=\"elementor elementor-1701\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-29e49ab4 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"67219\" data-id=\"29e49ab4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5402f001\" data-eae-slider=\"66969\" data-id=\"5402f001\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4c497a67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4c497a67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"894\" height=\"427\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/canada.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-5827\" alt=\"canada\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/canada.jpg 894w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/canada-300x143.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/canada-768x367.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 894px) 100vw, 894px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"></figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-912b33b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"75055\" data-id=\"912b33b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6811bc36\" data-eae-slider=\"68536\" data-id=\"6811bc36\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b7e5dfa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1b7e5dfa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About the Canada Lotto 6/49 Lottery\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3338cdf9 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"76531\" data-id=\"3338cdf9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-52b11059\" data-eae-slider=\"71167\" data-id=\"52b11059\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49743ecc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"49743ecc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When it comes to the </span><b>lottery, Canada Lotto</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is among the most lucrative in Canada. The prizes go as high as CA $60 million, and it boasts fantastic odds for a national lottery. </span></p><p> </p><p><b>Canada Lotto lottery numbers </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">are between 1 and 49, and this is the range that can land you the jackpot. Plus, there's another 10-digit number set for a prize draw of CA $1 million.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The superior odds are what sets Canada Lotto apart from other competitions</span><b>. </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The jackpot odds are 1 in 13,983,816, among the lowest in the industry. Even better, your chances of winning a prize are about 1 in 6.6, so why not try it?</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Numerous </span><b>Canada Lotto lottery winners</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> testify to its value. The biggest jackpots nation-wide came from this competition. In 2005, a person won CA $54.3 million, but another competitor beat it in 2015, obtaining a jaw-dropping sum of CA $64 million.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can also try your luck for as low as CA $3 per play, on Wednesdays and Sundays each week in Toronto. The </span><b>results of the Canada Lotto lottery </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">are randomly-drawn numbers using a Smartplay Halogen II machine.</span></p><p><br /><b>Canada Lotto lottery results </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">come with a transparency and fairness guarantee, thanks to the Interprovincial Lottery Corporation that manages it.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-24bedeb5 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"62730\" data-id=\"24bedeb5\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1647064e\" data-eae-slider=\"70508\" data-id=\"1647064e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f2a209d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7f2a209d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Canada Lotto 6/49 FAQ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1559d07a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-eae-slider=\"51457\" data-id=\"1559d07a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3f89d090\" data-eae-slider=\"42178\" data-id=\"3f89d090\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25c9f28b elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"25c9f28b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-25c9f28b\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"25c9f28b\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"who-can-play-canada-lotto\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6331\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Who can play Canada Lotto?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6331\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"who-can-play-canada-lotto\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Regarding minimum age, you have to be 18 or older in:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Alberta,</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Manitoba</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Northwest Territories</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Nunavut</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Ontario</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Quebec </span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yukon Territories</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you're from the following areas, you need to be at least 19:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">British Columbia</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Labrador</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">New Brunswick</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Newfoundland</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Nova Scotia</span></li><li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Prince Edward Island</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Participation isn't limited to Canadian players. Online concierge services selling Lotto 6/49 tickets are available to foreigners, although there'll be a small fee attached.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-can-i-buy-a-ticket\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6332\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When can I buy a ticket?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6332\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"when-can-i-buy-a-ticket\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The ticket sales on playing locations close at 21.00 EST on the evening of the draw. They'll reopen later that night for the next round. However, if you're using a concierge service, remember that the cut-off time might be earlier. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"who-won-the-biggest-canada-lotto-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6333\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Who won the biggest Canada Lotto lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6333\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"who-won-the-biggest-canada-lotto-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The most significant amount of money ever to go to a single person in Canada Lotto was CA $64 million, won by Zhe Wang. Hers was the only winning ticket in that draw. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-play-the-canada-lotto-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6334\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How to play the Canada Lotto lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6334\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-play-the-canada-lotto-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You start by choosing six main numbers (1-49) and a bonus number. Apart from hitting all six for a jackpot, you can win big if you match five numbers and the bonus. Every time the grand prize goes unclaimed, the jackpot pool increases.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-win-the-canada-lotto-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6335\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How to win the Canada Lotto lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6335\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-win-the-canada-lotto-lottery\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If two of your ticket numbers match the lotto machine's ones, you're winning a free ticket for the next draw. The prize sizes grow with every new match, but only all six main numbers grant you a jackpot.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"whats-the-guaranteed-prize-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6336\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What's the Guaranteed Prize Draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6336\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"whats-the-guaranteed-prize-draw\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Apart from the main game, you can participate in a supplementary competition. In it, one ticket holder wins CA $1 million on each draw. You'll buy a ticket with a ten-digit code, and if yours matches the one drawn, the money is yours. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-i-cash-in-my-lottery-tickets\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6337\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How do I cash in my lottery tickets?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6337\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-i-cash-in-my-lottery-tickets\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you win, you'll get your entire prize in a single lump-sum. Plus, Canada doesn't impose taxes on lottery winnings, which means you'd receive the whole sum of your profit. You have one year to claim your prize in select locations. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"is-there-a-canada-lotto-lottery-app\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-6338\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Is there a Canada Lotto lottery app?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6338\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"is-there-a-canada-lotto-lottery-app\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes. It updates once every five minutes and sends push notifications when the results come out. Unfortunately, it doesn't contain a </span><b>Canada Lotto lottery ticket scanner, </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">for which you have to use a separate app.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-533423b7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"17395\" data-id=\"533423b7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-313ae66c\" data-eae-slider=\"12075\" data-id=\"313ae66c\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-138e3323 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"138e3323\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the <b>Canada Lotto 6/49</b>? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-12756a90\" data-eae-slider=\"78519\" data-id=\"12756a90\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c1b4fef elementor-align-center elementor-button-success elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"5c1b4fef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-lg\" href=\"/Contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Send Us an Email</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-85e11b6 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"70369\" data-id=\"85e11b6\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-347d908\" data-eae-slider=\"95784\" data-id=\"347d908\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5558623 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"5558623\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Who can play Canada Lotto?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Regarding minimum age, you have to be 18 or older in:\\n\\n  * Alberta,\\n  * Manitoba\\n  * Northwest Territories\\n  * Nunavut\\n  * Ontario\\n  * Quebec \\n  * Yukon Territories\\n\\n \\n\\nIf you're from the following areas, you need to be at least 19:\\n\\n  * British Columbia\\n  * Labrador\\n  * New Brunswick\\n  * Newfoundland\\n  * Nova Scotia\\n  * Prince Edward Island\\n\\n \\n\\nParticipation isn't limited to Canadian players. Online concierge services selling Lotto 6/49 tickets are available to foreigners, although there'll be a small fee attached.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When can I buy a ticket?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The ticket sales on playing locations close at 21.00 EST on the evening of the draw. They'll reopen later that night for the next round. However, if you're using a concierge service, remember that the cut-off time might be earlier.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Who won the biggest Canada Lotto lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The most significant amount of money ever to go to a single person in Canada Lotto was CA $64 million, won by Zhe Wang. Hers was the only winning ticket in that draw.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How to play the Canada Lotto lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You start by choosing six main numbers (1-49) and a bonus number. Apart from hitting all six for a jackpot, you can win big if you match five numbers and the bonus. Every time the grand prize goes unclaimed, the jackpot pool increases.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How to win the Canada Lotto lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"If two of your ticket numbers match the lotto machine's ones, you're winning a free ticket for the next draw. The prize sizes grow with every new match, but only all six main numbers grant you a jackpot.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What's the Guaranteed Prize Draw?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Apart from the main game, you can participate in a supplementary competition. In it, one ticket holder wins CA $1 million on each draw. You'll buy a ticket with a ten-digit code, and if yours matches the one drawn, the money is yours.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I cash in my lottery tickets?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"If you win, you'll get your entire prize in a single lump-sum. Plus, Canada doesn't impose taxes on lottery winnings, which means you'd receive the whole sum of your profit. You have one year to claim your prize in select locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a Canada Lotto lottery app?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes. It updates once every five minutes and sends push notifications when the results come out. Unfortunately, it doesn't contain a Canada Lotto lottery ticket scanner, for which you have to use a separate app.\"}}]}</script>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
